 3
Write a program that displays the Top N salaries using
Simple Explicit Cursor.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> ACCEPT P_N PROMPT 'Enter N Value : '

sql> DECLARE

CURSOR C1 IS
SELECT *
FROM
(
SELECT EMPNO,ENAME,SAL
FROM EMP
ORDER BY SAL DESC
)
WHERE ROWNUM<=&P_N;

R C1%ROWTYPE;

BEGIN

OPEN C1;

LOOP

FETCH C1 INTO R;

EXIT WHEN C1%NOTFOUND;

DBMS_OUTPUT.PUT_LINE
(R.EMPNO||' '||R.ENAME||' '||R.SAL);

END LOOP;

CLOSE C1;

END;
/

Output:
-------

Enter N Value : 3

7839 KING 5000
7788 SCOTT 3000
7902 FORD 3000

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.


